      "filename": "Aircraft wreckage of Blackburn Botha L6202 on Llwytmor - geograph.org.uk - 832470.jpg",
      "title": "File:Aircraft wreckage of Blackburn Botha L6202 on Llwytmor - geograph.org.uk - 832470.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/ba/Aircraft_wreckage_of_Blackburn_Botha_L6202_on_Llwytmor_-_geograph.org.uk_-_832470.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Aircraft_wreckage_of_Blackburn_Botha_L6202_on_Llwytmor_-_geograph.org.uk_-_832470.jpg",
      "width": 640,
